So, I guess that would be
20, well, I'll say by 2040,

00:26:25.220 --> 00:26:26.720
to run for Senate.

00:26:28.028 --> 00:26:28.861
Yeah.

00:26:28.861 --> 00:26:32.219
Because, millennials will be
the politicians of that time.

