00:26:38.991 --> 00:26:41.588
And they're going to know all
my dirty laundry before I run.

00:26:41.588 --> 00:26:42.921
So, I won't have to hide anything.

00:26:42.921 --> 00:26:45.338
So, I can just run as myself.

00:26:47.102 --> 00:26:48.456
