00:28:25.543 --> 00:28:27.903
Daniel, last message of the day.

00:28:27.903 --> 00:28:28.736
This is it.

00:28:28.736 --> 00:28:31.447
This is your time to wrap it
all up, into a nice bow for us,

00:28:31.447 --> 00:28:33.067
and leave us on a high.

00:28:33.067 --> 00:28:34.437
What do ya got, man?

00:28:34.437 --> 00:28:35.447
- Well, I can't leave you quite at a high,

00:28:35.447 --> 00:28:36.747
'cause I'm in North
Carolina, and not California,

00:28:36.747 --> 00:28:38.579
but I will tell you this!

00:28:38.579 --> 00:28:42.120
(sighs) When everyone else doubts ya...

00:28:42.120 --> 00:28:45.040
When you're havin' trouble
seein' the end of the tunnel...

00:28:45.040 --> 00:28:45.873
When you're workin' hard, or something,

00:28:45.873 --> 00:28:48.122
and it's not workin' out...

00:28:48.122 --> 00:28:50.191
You just got to believe.

00:28:50.191 --> 00:28:51.910
(Evan laughing)

00:28:51.910 --> 00:28:53.358
- And you know that's going
to hit with this audience!

00:28:53.358 --> 00:28:54.916
- [Daniel] You just got to believe!

00:28:54.916 --> 00:28:55.767
